OL,14,G0306 Outlook
OL,15,     FDown on his luck, Hans Fenger
OL,16,     Ffound joy teaching kids rock
OL,17,     Fsongs. His ragtag band recorded an
OL,18,     Funlikely hit album - loved by
OL,19,     FDavid Bowie - and inspired the
OL,20,     Ffilm School of Rock.
